73391845_2022791841535994_6381591123241693989_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=od3RV4xZ47IQ7kNvwFwlo9w&_nc_oc=Adon0nHVEOmMaPfnrKzT3vQ6hhfCCIltyvSjZUhxVs0BRhRIR8FQExzqQIvg1E8Te50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_S-aLVubotKRR-hEab1lCJlLaS3hXWBUyysjCqCEZ76w&oe=6A22E969"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "650141244188879", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391716_650141250855545_8040660470448703299_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2-tjkLvcOVEQ7kNvwFSxttc&_nc_oc=AdpBTt_Lc3PpKfQcX_UU4Mmm6ddnd5n-utYrK95bbiwbqnuCzZq7PlEEW3xGYTJb7vg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9wMsMQ-xhacMRVSn4_-r7xFKornjspEtlkaRn11KV7mw&oe=6A22C800"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "659135163455703", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393463_659135170122369_7227157406125140691_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mx__4X4CsaAQ7kNvwGoOuKA&_nc_oc=AdrCGaNmMmbdcXGJQ7X1uZm9WpN3vuVI3XnTJn5fgEtIZ-Pag0wyxetv-IdRa8qT3sk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-87BfsK1_aztW7Y3LTtCL5pg-GZBwUg7Ztz-Ybpou62g&oe=6A22E164"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1303847337568193", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393059_1303847340901526_2938449234628070226_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EJQiAaqazwkQ7kNvwF36ZRr&_nc_oc=AdoyCdZIbSnmZLZt2-HJ3PAhIr9S8yBCrc4tGFJDC3UAkZrxrfqPb0ULELUvzn6SDF0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af98aG7I1NXRQ0IMYmkbVQM46Tc9aaHY_GarOVewnSUUpg&oe=6A22CCEA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PosterVideoTriler.png", "id": "2298977923791758", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391888_2298977927125091_343536883905062208_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s7WJZPUSujkQ7kNvwHmqSJ2&_nc_oc=Adp-KWhRT42AY8pfVXWt5QIuY3659mUk5ekKK1tXmiRSaeOwrvBxmeUPranyvNSTdw0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8N0K0pAw3Anlg9JAlii1_MlwNzUabnc7pUx3GweIs1YQ&oe=6A22DEF8"}, "display_name": "Hellfire Rampage", "keywords": ["Fighting", "shooter", "Action", "demons", "combat"], "long_description": "HELLFIRE RAMPAGE VR is an action-based combat game that blends shooting and melee fighting mechanics.\n\nYou are a genius portal inventor who has detected an abnormal signal from another world.\nAfter investigating, you discover that hellish creatures are collecting magical crystal essences and preparing to invade the HUMANITY\n\n-> YOUR MISSION IS TO STOP THEIR INVASION AND COLLECT THE CRYSTALS !\n\nUse your ability to slow time and take on powerful enemies in intense battles.\n[BULLET TIME + DASH] is a toxic combination for tactical movements and survival.\n\n-> REFLECT BULLETS BACK BY RICOCHET WITH ANY WEAPON\n\nCombine a magic wand with a talisman or a shotgun with a sickle.\nLaunch fireballs, swing a lightsaber, throw shurikens, or even play a demonic kalimba.\nThe arsenal is packed with epic gear, from chainsaws to crossbows and beyond!\nGet ready to test around 30+ non-trivial guns!\n\n\nFace dangerous hordes and destroy their source.\nPrepare to meet skeletons, imps, demons, hellhounds and mad ravens,\nundead summon kings, skull queens, giant devils, toxic moths and others...\n\n-> HELL CREATURES WILL NOT LET YOU TO GET BORED!\n\nThe most thrilling and intense fights are waiting for you.\n\nAround 70+ challenges from different mysterious locations\n\n-> GET READY TO SWEAT IN MORTAL CHALLENGES\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Are you brave enough to challenge the HELL?", "short_description": "Hellfire Rampage VR - true and hot battle against hordes of demons!\n\n- Find magical essences to boost your power.\n- Use slow-motion and dash jumps to destroy enemies.\n- Try over 30 epic and unique weapons.\n- Face terrifying hellish creatures with their own combat mechanics.\n\nYou are humanity\u2019s last hope - defeat the undead army and survive!"}]}, "de